KUBRA KO AJAB RAAT YEH KHISMAT NE DIKHAYI<br>
Kubra Ko Ajab Raat Yeh Khismat Ne Dikhayi Kal Hoyengi Bewa<br>
Kangna Bhi Bhadha Haath Me Mehandi Bhi Lagayi Kal Hoyengi Bewa<br>
<br>
1.Nousha Bhi Shehzada Dulhan Bhi Hai Khuzadi Kya Khoob Hai Shadi<br>
Wo Ibne Hasan Aur Yeh Shabbir Ki Jaayi Kal Hoyengi Bewa<br>
<br>
2.Ek Shab Se Ziyada Na Rahengi Yeh Suhagan Takhdeer Hai Dushman<br>
Lootege Aadu Zouja e Shabbar Ki Kamai Kal Hoyengi Bewa<br>
<br>
3.Pamaal Karinge Tan-e-Nousha Ko Aada Looth Jayenga Sehra<br>
Tar Khoon Me Hojayangi Yeh Dast e Hinayi Kal Hoyengi Bewa<br>
<br>
4.Ghunghat Me Dulhan Rorahi Hai Sar Ko Jukaye Chehre Ko Chupaye<br>
Maa Phupiyun Se Sharmati Hai Gardu Ki Satayi Kal Hoyengi Bewa
